    </refsect1>

  <refsect1>
    <title>Examples</title>

    <para><screen>varlinkctl introspect <replaceable>SERVICE</replaceable> io.systemd.oom</screen> shows the
    interface definition as served by <replaceable>SERVICE</replaceable>, and
    <screen>varlinkctl call <replaceable>SERVICE</replaceable> io.systemd.oom.ReportManagedOOMCGroups '{}'</screen>
    invokes its <function>ReportManagedOOMCGroups</function> method.</para>
  </refsect1>

